  "prefLabel": "He-W 572.09 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 572.09 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #8638, eff 5-30-06; ss by #10294, eff 12-1-13 (from He-W 572.08); ss by #13840, INTERIM, eff 12-29-23; ss by #14007, eff 6-25-24",
